<h1 id="jekyllmigrationscaffold">Jekyll migration scaffold</h1>

<p>This repo has a basic Jekyll scaffolding with layouts and includes.</p>

<p>Build locally:</p>

<pre><code class="bash">gem install bundler jekyll
bundle init
# Add `gem &quot;jekyll&quot;` to the generated Gemfile, then:
bundle install
bundle exec jekyll serve
</code></pre>

<p>Notes:</p>

<ul>
<li>The site currently references the existing <code>styles.css</code> at the repo root. Move SCSS into <code>_sass/</code> and update <code>assets</code> as desired.</li>
<li>Convert existing pages to include YAML front matter and <code>layout: page</code>.</li>
</ul>

